                        Mertonehalle’ (fol. 253, s. xv)‘Istud [sic in Thomson] librum donauit M.
                        Henricus Abyndone custos de Mertonehalle in Oxoniam [sic in Thomson] eiusdem
                        domus scolaribus ut inchatenetur [sic in Thomson] in eorum libraria nunc
                        exhibendus cum licencia custodis et sex seniorum eiusdem domus. Et est
                        postilla super ecclesiasticum cum uno subtili tractatu edito super materia
                        de confessione et absoluende [sic in Thomson] facta cum uirtute priuilegii
                        concessi fratribus’ (fol. iv)This became an electio book and was then
                        repeatedly pledged to loan-chests; several cautiones are recorded by
                        Thomson, Merton, 118.‘Donauit Scholaribus de Merton Hall in Oxon’ Magister
                        Henricus Abyndon eiusdem domus Custos’ (fol. ivv, s. xvii
                     in.)</p></provenance>
